<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Your
vote is very important to us.</B> Whether or not you expect to be present in person at the Special Meeting, please sign the enclosed
proxy card and return it promptly in the envelope provided, or vote via Internet or telephone. Instructions are provided on the proxy
card. Returning the proxy card does not deprive you of your right to attend the Special Meeting and to vote your shares in person. <B>Abstentions
will have the same effect as a vote </B>&ldquo;<B>AGAINST</B>&rdquo; <B>the Advisory Agreement Proposal.</B></FONT></P>

