otherwise indicated, to our knowledge, each stockholder listed below has sole voting and investment power with respect to the shares
beneficially owned by the stockholder, except to the extent authority is shared by spouses under applicable law, and maintains an address
of c/o SuRo Capital Corp., 640 Fifth Avenue, 12th Floor, New York, New York 10019.</FONT></P>

