                                                                   <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>Administrative Expenses, and Advisory Fees</B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>(as a percentage of total assets)</B></FONT></P></TD><TD STYLE="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1pt">&nbsp;</TD>
